# Reproduction for the accent bug. Make a timer, set a dark accent, then shoot
# the menu with the timer row highlighted while running (play icon on the
# dark highlight) and while paused (pause icon), plus the cog row highlighted.

note make a 25:00 timer
wait 4              # the app's first window needs to be up before presses land
press select        # off hours
press up 25         # twenty-five minutes
press select        # off minutes
press select        # confirm -- detail opens
press back          # menu, cursor on the timer row
press down          # to the cog row
press select        # Settings
press down 4        # to the Accent Color row
press select        # the colour picker, opening on Malachite
press down 3        # Dark Candy Apple Red
press select        # applies and pops back to settings
press back          # the recoloured menu, cursor on the cog row
press up            # cursor on the timer row, running: play on dark highlight
shot highlighted-play
press select        # detail
press select        # pause the timer
press back          # menu: paused timer, cursor still on its row
shot highlighted-pause
press down          # to the cog row: cog on dark highlight
shot highlighted-cog
